sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant topics as topics.js
  participant API as POST /api/topics
  participant DATA as DATA.topics + filtered ids
  participant Chart as Chart.js

  API->>DATA: Intersect topic post_ids with filtered set
  API-->>topics: topics [{topic_id, label, post_count, ...}]
  topics->>Chart: horizontal bar (post_count)
  Chart-->>User: Topic labels (truncated)

  User->>Chart: Click bar
  Chart->>topics: onClick → topic_id
  topics->>User: openDrawer("topic", topic_id)
